    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="main-content">

<!-- HERO -->
<section id="hero" aria-label="Introduction">
  <div class="hero-blob" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="bface" id="bface">
      <div class="bface-eyes">
        <div class="bface-eye" id="bfey-l"><span class="bface-pupil"></span></div>
        <div class="bface-eye" id="bfey-r"><span class="bface-pupil"></span></div>
      </div>
      <svg class="bface-smile" viewBox="0 0 56 24" fill="none">
        <path id="bface-mouth" d="M5 6 Q28 22 51 6" stroke="rgba(0,229,255,.38)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-pre">Prabuddha Verma</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">
      <span class="role-cycle" id="rcycle">
        <span class="role-word active" id="rw0">AI Engineer</span>
        <span class="role-word"        id="rw1">RAG Builder</span>
        <span class="role-word"        id="rw2">Go Developer</span>
      <!-- </span><br>+ Developer -->
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Freelance engineer — <strong>web apps, mobile apps, AI systems &amp; automation</strong>. Full-stack from React to Golang to production ML. Two patents. Graduating 2026.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#works" class="btn btn-fill">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 1v10M3 7l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        View My Work
      </a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-out">Let's Talk</a>
    </div>
  </div>
