    <h2 class="s-head reveal rd1">Hi there</h2>
    <p style="font-size:15px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text-b);margin-bottom:16px;" class="reveal rd2">I'm Prabuddha — a software engineer and freelancer who designs, builds, and ships full-stack products. <strong style="color:var(--text)">Web apps, mobile apps, AI systems, automation pipelines, backend infrastructure.</strong> If it needs to be fast, reliable, and production-ready — that's my domain. Final year at <a href="https://vit.ac.in" target="_blank" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;">VIT Chennai</a>, graduating 2026.</p>
    <p style="font-size:15px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text-b);margin-bottom:24px;" class="reveal rd3">Available for <strong style="color:var(--text)">freelance & contract work</strong> across web development (React, Next.js), mobile apps (React Native), AI & automation (RAG, LLMs, computer vision, workflow bots), and backend systems (Golang, Node.js, PostgreSQL, Docker). Two patents. Oracle GenAI & AWS certified.</p>
    <div class="skill-row reveal rd2">
      <span class="skill-pill">Python</span><span class="skill-pill">Golang</span><span class="skill-pill">LangChain</span><span class="skill-pill">LlamaIndex</span><span class="skill-pill">RAG / Agentic RAG</span><span class="skill-pill">FAISS · Qdrant</span><span class="skill-pill">PostgreSQL</span><span class="skill-pill">Docker</span><span class="skill-pill">React Native</span><span class="skill-pill">TensorFlow</span><span class="skill-pill">Whisper</span><span class="skill-pill">DistilBERT · ViT</span>
