      <h2 class="cbig reveal rd1">Let's work<br>together.</h2>
      <p class="csub reveal rd2">I'm actively looking for full-time roles in AI engineering and backend development. If you're building something ambitious and want someone who ships — let's talk.</p>
      <div class="cact reveal rd3">
